Remember the subject!  You may or may not consider some of this to be spoilers,
but I will stick in a ^L here just in case...

This character ascended on Unix Nethack.  All around fairly mediocre, however
he did have a nice bonus of getting two extra wishes beyond the five from the
wand of wishing in the castle, one from a magic lamp and one from a throne.
Items wished for:

	blessed luckstone
	blessed bag of holding
	3 blessed scrolls of charging (got one)
	blessed +3 shield of reflection (got it)
	blessed +3 gray dragon scale mail (got +0)
	blessed +3 speed boots (got +0)
	3 cursed scrolls of teleportation (got all three)

Also managed to genocide Rust Monsters using a throne (the most wonderful
monster to genocide, IMHO).  Wizard of Yendor was on level 47 (yecch!), but I
mapped out the stairs ahead of time as suggested here previously, so I was 
still able to  get out fairly quickly.  Got stuck for a LONG time at level 41,
because I kept getting sucked back down the stairs.  Wizard appeard about 8 or 
9 times, stole the Amulet once, but was fairly easily disposed of.  Amulet
didn't hurt me too much with the usual cursing of items, mostly armor that I
didn't want to take off anyhow.  I hate to say it, but the trip up from Hell
was rather dull (it sounds like this is going to change in the next version,
though).

